Commands to setup backend:
py -m pip install fastapi
py -m pip install uvicorn
py -m pip install yfinance
py -m pip install pandas
py -m pip install scikit-learn

Once installed, go to command prompt and navigate to the path that has model.py. Then, run this command: uvicorn main:app --reload
Once running, click the local host link that comes up. Then add /docs to the end of it to get to the fastAPI.
